art":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3094702874","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108806#issuecomment-3094702874","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108806","id":3094702874,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64dWsa","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-20T18:49:05Z","updated_at":"2025-07-20T18:49:05Z","body":"> It used to have an extra define; this was removed in your commit https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/3d60ce9389bab3bbb0af325a00e6773c0860f225.\r\n\r\nNot this is unrelated, it should be a define for non-builtin version and use `#if defied(ICU_STATIC_DATA) || defined(EXTERNAL_ICU)`.\r\n\r\n> If this is wrong, why do the unit tests not fail in CI?\r\n\r\nYes, it actually won't break it fully, just introduce a bunch of unneeded load code (lookup for `res://icudt_godot.dat`).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3094702874/reactions","total_count